"""thermal-report - a single evidence file for a repair shop or a warranty claim.

Assembles what is normally missing after a hard shutdown, when the system log simply ends
at the moment the machine died: the guard's measurement timeline (chip temperature, fan rpm,
power draw, power source), detected hard shutdowns together with the readings that preceded
them, every intervention the guard made, and the hardware state.

Usage:
  thermal-report                    # last 7 days -> ~/Desktop (plain text)
  thermal-report --days 30
  thermal-report --pdf              # additionally render a PDF next to the text file
  thermal-report --file /path/report.txt

Language: TG_LANG=en|pl, or "lang" in ~/.thermal-guard/config.json. Default: en.
"""

